sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant L as layout / LineLayout
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    P->>UI: click Load track..., choose green_line.json
    UI->>S: inspectTrackConfig(url)
    S->>S: inspect_track_config(path)
    S->>L: load_layout_file(path)
    L->>L: load_layout_file internal: json.load, then parse_layout(data, name)
    alt not a layout, or a wayside database
        L-->>S: raise LayoutError(reason)
        S-->>UI: return {ok: false, error}
        UI-->>P: the reason is shown, nothing changes
    else a valid layout
        L-->>S: return LineLayout (undivided)
        S->>M: controllers_for(line.name)
        M-->>S: return the waysides it would replace
        S-->>UI: return {line, blocks, switches, crossings, controllers: default_controllers, replaces}
        UI-->>P: confirmation, with the fixed wayside count
        P->>UI: click Load
        UI->>S: loadTrackConfig(url)
        S->>S: load_track_config(path)
        S->>L: load_layout_file(path)
        L-->>S: return LineLayout (undivided)
        S->>L: divide()
        Note right of L: The count is default_controllers (WAYSIDE_COUNTS), fixed by the track, never chosen.
        L-->>S: return LineLayout with one ControllerConfig per wayside
        S->>M: load_track(line)
        M->>M: load_track internal: drop the waysides of the same line, with their programs
        loop each ControllerConfig (_install)
            M->>W: TrackController(config, blocks, line.key)
            W->>W: __init__ internal: vital_source(config, blocks), then compile_program
            M->>W: scan()
            W->>W: scan internal: no program yet, so idle(reason)
        end
        M-->>S: return the ids of the replaced waysides
        S->>S: load_track_config internal: select the line and its first wayside, _load_buffer_from_controller()
        S-->>UI: emit selectionChanged, bufferChanged, controllerChanged
        UI-->>P: line and waysides listed, NOT READY
    end
